# === FcRIIB-Paper-Code .gitignore ===
# Keeps the repo to source + input data. Anything generated when you run the
# notebooks (or by RStudio / Office) is ignored, so it never clutters the repo.

# --- Figures the notebooks write out (regenerated on every run) ---
*.pdf
*.png
*.svg

# --- Result tables written by Erk_KTR_Trace_Analysis.ipynb ---
# (input data like ALL CONC.csv / IgG.csv is NOT matched by these)
*_results.csv
*_summary.csv

# --- Jupyter / Python housekeeping ---
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.virtual_documents/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# --- R / RStudio ---
.Rproj.user
*.Rproj
.RData
.Rhistory
.Rapp.history
# README files created by RStudio
*README.html
*README_cache/
#*README_files/

# --- Office / editor temp files ---
*~
~$*.doc*
~$*.xls*
*.xlk
~$*.ppt*

# --- OS / editor junk ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
